# Bazel
# The convenience symlinks are named after the enclosing directory, so a git
# worktree produces bazel-<worktree-name> rather than bazel-visual-review.
# Root-anchored, since this is only ever where Bazel puts them.
/bazel-*
MODULE.bazel.lock

